  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till SMT/WHO Kosovo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to SMT/WHO Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Gjakova sjukhusadministration. Projektm&#xe5;let innefattar st&#xf6;d och medel f&#xf6;r att verksamaheten ska kunna fortg&#xe5; under en transitionsfas tills UNMIK kan ta &#xf6;ver. Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra sjukv&#xe5;rdssystemet (fr&#xe4;mst vad g&#xe4;ller administration och koordinering) i Kosovo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the hospital administration in Gjakova. The short-term goal is to provide funds to enable the hospital and the management team to function during a transition period until UNMIK is able to take over. The overall objective is to improve the health care system, management and co-ordination in Kosovo.</narrative>
  </description>
